rule build_tsinfer_arg:
    """Build a tsinfer-inferred ARG from the ingroup VCF for one
    ``(chunk_idx, f_del)`` cell. Outgroups are dropped before tsinfer
    runs: the tsinfer-ARG inference path is ingroup-only by design.
